            <ArticleTitle>Clinical management. Where medicine meets management. Heart act to follow.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>28-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Areas taking part in the original CHD collaborative have seen a fourfold reduction in deaths from heart attacks. Improvements are based on more rigorous and accurate information gathering. The skills learned should cover the 10 clinical domains of the new GP contract--and more.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
